    <header>
        <h1>Mama Njeri's Story</h1>
        <p>From the heart of Westlands, where every dish is a love letter to the community.</p>
    </header>

    <section class="story">
        <h2>Our Story</h2>
        <p>Mama Njeri is a beloved local chef who has been crafting delicious meals for over 20 years. Her kitchen is a haven of warmth and flavor, where every dish is a celebration of heritage and tradition.</p>
    </section>

    <section class="team">
        <h2>The Kitchen Team</h2>
        <p>The Westlands kitchen is a team of passionate individuals who work together to bring the best of what they do. From the front of the line to the back of the oven, everyone is committed to excellence.</p>
    </section>

    <section class="photos">
        <h2>Photos of the Westlands Kitchen</h2>
        <img src="https://via.placeholder.com/400x200" alt="Westlands Kitchen" class="photo">
